# Run N (2026-11-07, user: "restart with actor update same frequency as critic",
# then "4x more updates (every 5 steps)"): run M (slurm/sac_scratch_2t.env: SAC
# from scratch, no pretraining, image-only critic, standard temperature, PER,
# Town05 + Town01) with one learner update every 5 environment steps instead of
# 20 -- 4x the gradient steps per environment step for the critic AND the actor,
# which already updated 1:1 (ACTOR_UPDATE_EVERY 1). Run M's actor was still near
# uniform (-log pi 1.19-1.37) after ~10,000 updates (step ~207k).
. "$REPO/slurm/sac_scratch_2t.env"
export UPDATE_EVERY=5
